    ro.innerHTML = kv([['positive tests', tp + fp], ['true positives', tp, 'c1'], ['false alarms', fp, 'c2'], ['P(condition | positive)', fmt(100 * post, 1) + '%', 'hi']]) + '<span class="hint">1,000 people. Teal: have it and test positive. Coral: false alarms. Pale teal: have it but the test missed them. When the condition is rare, false alarms can outnumber true cases even with a good test.</span>';
